{"posts":[{"id":"alex_p13_301","t":"Kovalenko wrote: I found nice Foto in the internet. Gold rule: work and relax must be 50\\50\n\nHave a nice weekend!\n\nlol","a":"juniormaiafx","d":"","n":"#301","p":13,"im":["59e93b524393964faa3ff2a67eb399a112b1ee5f"],"m":301},{"id":"alex_p13_302","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#302","p":13,"im":["ac501fe7b98031daddf614ac7c6e254af161e6b5"],"m":302},{"id":"alex_p13_303","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#303","p":13,"im":["df6cadc0b0e68b57a07c24832b5935f0ade0e609"],"m":303},{"id":"alex_p13_304","t":"Hello Kovalenko. I have one very confusing thing. How do you confirm to enter when price engulf and back to ftr zone please help me?","a":"smile","d":"","n":"#304","p":13,"im":[],"m":304},{"id":"alex_p13_305","t":"smile wrote: Hello Kovalenko. I have one very confusing thing. How do you confirm to enter when price engulf and back to ftr zone please help me?\n\nHi smile, Price engulfed FTR ( 2 times). Please note, when price came back - there was no HH, only LH\n\nAlso -the Last GAP, please note, after it, I marked red S/R, price engulfed this level. Then price retested CAP and went down.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#305","p":13,"im":[],"m":305},{"id":"alex_p13_306","t":"Sorry no charts, I am in a business trip now. Good luck to all. I wish everybody to have a lot of profits.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#306","p":13,"im":[],"m":306},{"id":"alex_p13_307","t":"I miss your posts alex!! Have fun on your business trip! Any live swing trade?","a":"projectsagana","d":"","n":"#307","p":13,"im":[],"m":307},{"id":"alex_p13_308","t":"Find strong down\\up movement. Find only key ENG, key FTR, key FLAG. No need to trade every ENG, every FTR. Step by step price shows us what we should do. Follow the market.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#308","p":13,"im":["a2de0a313cef4b47ecc7ff97a9badfb579013f91"],"m":308},{"id":"alex_p13_309","t":"Alex, you are my savior lol That's my analysis, the CPAZ and FO Zone are correct?","a":"juniormaiafx","d":"","n":"#309","p":13,"im":["9fa4715a0b191be6cc74a2f2e7d95b890df9b8ba"],"m":309},{"id":"alex_p13_310","t":"Hi alex, How do you define strong move? Ok this I understand the larger the candle body the stronger the move. It could be subjective to each person. But how do you define key eng, key ftr and key flag? Could you show me the different between key eng,ftr,flag and non important eng,ftr,flag. Thanks.","a":"gristar","d":"","n":"#310","p":13,"im":[],"m":310},{"id":"alex_p13_311","t":"Hi juniormaiafx","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#311","p":13,"im":["ae8a14a64d0b1a19acd1251155d5cbb553af54d3"],"m":311},{"id":"alex_p13_312","t":"Kovalenko wrote: Hi juniormaiafx\n\nHey Brother... thank you very much!!!","a":"juniormaiafx","d":"","n":"#312","p":13,"im":["ae8a14a64d0b1a19acd1251155d5cbb553af54d3"],"m":312},{"id":"alex_p13_313","t":"Hi Gristar Find obvious Swings. For example, here below, then creating FTR, Eng, and so on.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#313","p":13,"im":["83f7cb719fa6587e84d555f8d4620bba43e3cc7c","e3ce3e5923cf845c91f0606a0bc77560f8eb2fe3"],"m":313},{"id":"alex_p13_314","t":"Thanks a lot. Nice explanation here Alex.","a":"Man","d":"","n":"#314","p":13,"im":[],"m":314},{"id":"alex_p13_315","t":"trades","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#315","p":13,"im":["e484ef1f4346eb7fdde10fdf7c3e1da340344df0","9cace3ebb64cbe6bf9fcfbd34164cb914b485c6b"],"m":315},{"id":"alex_p13_316","t":"Nice one, seems like a few people were on this. I had same trade, same target, was going for the tight stop for good RR, didn't notice the QM level, pipped out. Rookie error!","a":"smimon","d":"","n":"#316","p":13,"im":[],"m":316},{"id":"alex_p13_317","t":"Hi Alex! Nice trade on GBPUSD! I have 2 questions according to it: 1) Was your target the bottom blue rectangle on your chart or the target was (is) somewhere else? 2) Is there any HTF confirmation about your trade? (for example engulfing of the FL at 1.59377 few days ago)?:)\n\nThank you!","a":"kkb","d":"","n":"#317","p":13,"im":[],"m":317},{"id":"alex_p13_318","t":"kkb wrote: Hi Alex! Nice trade on GBPUSD! I have 2 questions according to it: 1) Was your target the bottom blue rectangle on your chart or the target was (is) somewhere else? 2) Is there any HTF confirmation about your trade? (for example engulfing of the FL at 1.59377 few days ago)?:)\n\nThank you!\n\nHi\n\nI marked -1. Tg 2. it was FTR - FTB I closed a deal early (technical mistake)","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#318","p":13,"im":["da0970f7c0503c5bbe58a40c5c107df4f014f05f"],"m":318},{"id":"alex_p13_319","t":"2trades today","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#319","p":13,"im":["7f7a4cc74d35a3c5093da51cbda99d03c3f7b09b"],"m":319},{"id":"alex_p13_320","t":"trade","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#320","p":13,"im":["474167f4ed3adc3e877398ec88ee7b98eb4c4abc"],"m":320},{"id":"alex_p13_321","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#321","p":13,"im":["78bd182700aa7c003b6d6810f5ddc3d89297876d","a950fc264b9cdbae0b7c93ae939b69cf21f73d3f","18a5e9f18ad208bbedc9a50c14b1958c06d6fea7","18b4c947df8a6880e235e244dc1fddefa1b18026"],"m":321},{"id":"alex_p13_322","t":"Great to see you posting again Alex! I always learn so much. Cheers.","a":"antraxia","d":"","n":"#322","p":13,"im":["f8c859f7e2ea370beb8a020385d8046e9a585e11"],"m":322},{"id":"alex_p13_323","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#323","p":13,"im":["8e30a3f02be876ef2f5d6d0be3e33e2f7eacbc7e","e28ca01d16bd8f099f2e2e95d8c45d3a2bc84177","83ab0fe34a0180d6bfd0eb96d751c061214df197","eca2061cb1d92aca68835df2a66fc2e447ff208a","83a15da241333a4d944f906d7035a56216858651"],"m":323},{"id":"alex_p13_324","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#324","p":13,"im":["6a03f7892a00d4949c646a391dea77212a55291f","8b324599d0f06813aa1a576972204c46fff19a1f"],"m":324},{"id":"alex_p13_325","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#325","p":13,"im":["72d103483bf9618192c4dd465b80b747595919ee"],"m":325}],"images":[{"k":"59e93b524393964faa3ff2a67eb399a112b1ee5f","t":"assets/thumbs/59e93b524393964faa3ff2a67eb399a112b1ee5f.webp","f":"assets/images/59e93b524393964faa3ff2a67